#N canvas 120 60 820 420 12;
#X text 20 10 fs_pluck <name> <root_midi> - pluck for a raw-IMU sensor: tilt (10..150 deg) chooses the note \; a sharp flick (acc_mag crossing 2 g \, re-arm below 1.3 g \, 120 ms refractory) plays it \, 2..4 g -> velocity 0.3..1. Inlet: scale messages. Sound lives in fs_pluck_voice., f 100;
#X obj 20 110 fs_in \$1 tilt;
#X obj 20 140 fs_map 10 150 0 1;
#X obj 300 110 fs_in \$1 acc_mag;
#X obj 300 140 fs_onset 2 1.3 120;
#X obj 300 170 fs_map 2 4 0.3 1;
#X obj 20 230 fs_pluck_voice \$2;
#X obj 20 270 outlet~;
#X obj 160 110 inlet;
#X connect 1 0 2 0;
#X connect 2 0 6 0;
#X connect 3 0 4 0;
#X connect 4 0 5 0;
#X connect 5 0 6 1;
#X connect 6 0 7 0;
#X connect 8 0 6 0;
